Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{=2}===============================DIALOGUE============================
Dialogue: 55,0:02:06.75,0:02:08.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's been quite a while, Chief.
Dialogue: 55,0:02:09.50,0:02:10.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hasn't it?
Dialogue: 55,0:02:13.51,0:02:17.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,As promised, we've brought Cutty Flam...\Nthe criminal responsible for assaulting
Dialogue: 55,0:02:17.88,0:02:21.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,government officials in\NWater Seven, 8 years ago.
Dialogue: 55,0:02:21.08,0:02:22.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And of course.
Dialogue: 55,0:02:22.08,0:02:25.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We also have Nico Robin,\Nthe last surviving resident of Ohara.
Dialogue: 55,0:02:25.99,0:02:29.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who we've been trying to capture\Nfor the past two decades.
Dialogue: 55,0:02:29.13,0:02:32.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're both waiting outside\Nif you would like to see them.
Dialogue: 55,0:02:32.89,0:02:35.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,In short, the mission\Nwas a huge success.
Dialogue: 55,0:02:35.74,0:02:38.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's good to have you back.
Dialogue: 55,0:02:38.01,0:02:38.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lucci.
Dialogue: 55,0:02:38.91,0:02:39.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaku.
Dialogue: 55,0:02:39.80,0:02:40.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Blueno.
Dialogue: 55,0:02:40.76,0:02:41.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kalifa.
Dialogue: 55,0:02:41.93,0:02:42.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's harassment.
Dialogue: 55,0:02:42.87,0:02:44.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All I did was say your name!
Dialogue: 55,0:02:48.77,0:02:51.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just like old times, huh, Lucci?
Dialogue: 55,0:02:51.71,0:02:55.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Actually, I think that you might\Nbe even more smug than before.
Dialogue: 55,0:02:55.00,0:02:59.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But sadly, you're\Nnot any smarter, Jabra.
Dialogue: 55,0:02:59.14,0:03:01.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 55,0:03:01.57,0:03:02.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on!
Dialogue: 55,0:03:02.51,0:03:03.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We've hardly even\Ngotten off of the train
Dialogue: 55,0:03:03.57,0:03:06.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and the first thing you\Ntwo do is start bickering?
Dialogue: 55,0:03:06.01,0:03:06.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yoyoi!
Dialogue: 55,0:03:06.91,0:03:08.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaakuu is riiiiight!
Dialogue: 55,0:03:08.78,0:03:13.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Can't we alllll just get aloooong?!
Dialogue: 55,0:03:13.38,0:03:20.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fooor fiiive loooong years we've\Nawaaaaited theiiir reeetuuurn!
Dialogue: 55,0:03:31.05,0:03:33.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Chapapa.
Dialogue: 55,0:03:40.25,0:03:41.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ow.
Dialogue: 55,0:03:41.52,0:03:45.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I had a feeling you were going\Nto test us right away, Fukurou.
Dialogue: 55,0:03:45.82,0:03:49.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Six Powers Skill-Competition!
Dialogue: 55,0:03:49.39,0:03:52.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}I'll use an armed guard as\Nreference for the ranking.
Dialogue: 55,0:03:52.29,0:03:53.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Let's say they're about a ten.
Dialogue: 55,0:03:53.90,0:03:56.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}So your power levels are.
Dialogue: 55,0:03:56.36,0:03:59.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ohhh, interesting, very interesting.
Dialogue: 55,0:03:59.23,0:04:00.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's see here.
Dialogue: 55,0:04:00.37,0:04:01.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,First is Kalifa.
Dialogue: 55,0:04:01.53,0:04:03.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Power level six hundred thirty.
Dialogue: 55,0:04:03.50,0:04:06.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Blueno is eight-hundred twenty.
Dialogue: 55,0:04:06.83,0:04:10.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaku is two-thousand, two hundred.
Dialogue: 55,0:04:10.14,0:04:12.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And Lucci.
Dialogue: 55,0:04:15.18,0:04:17.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Power level 4000!
Dialogue: 55,0:04:17.20,0:04:18.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,4000?
Dialogue: 55,0:04:18.34,0:04:20.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You gotta be making these numbers up!
Dialogue: 55,0:04:20.15,0:04:22.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's no such thing as\Na power level that high!
Dialogue: 55,0:04:22.29,0:04:23.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Cha pa pa!
Dialogue: 55,0:04:23.75,0:04:28.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, maybe not before now,\Nbut they've gotten stronger!
Dialogue: 55,0:04:28.23,0:04:30.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Since I measured\NJabra and Kumadori too.
Dialogue: 55,0:04:30.83,0:04:35.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can finally rank all of CP9!
Dialogue: 55,0:04:39.26,0:04:41.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No way, Fukurou, I want a recount!
Dialogue: 55,0:04:41.60,0:04:45.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Even if I ignore the whole Lucci thing,\Nwhy the hell am I weaker than Kaku!
Dialogue: 55,0:04:45.31,0:04:46.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,'Because Cha pa pa!
Dialogue: 55,0:04:46.78,0:04:50.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaku got stronger too, that's why!
Dialogue: 55,0:04:50.35,0:04:52.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't want you getting\Na big head over this Kaku.
Dialogue: 55,0:04:52.71,0:04:56.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just remember, the "Competition" technique\Nonly measures your physical strength!
Dialogue: 55,0:04:56.17,0:04:57.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,In a real battle,
Dialogue: 55,0:04:57.69,0:05:00.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I have my devil fruit powers\Nto help me out, too.
Dialogue: 55,0:05:00.50,0:05:03.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can trash a guy like you\Nany day of the week, got it?
Dialogue: 55,0:05:03.66,0:05:04.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't care.
Dialogue: 55,0:05:04.86,0:05:08.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If it makes you feel better,\Nkeep telling yourself that.
Dialogue: 55,0:05:08.10,0:05:09.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 55,0:05:09.24,0:05:13.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't pay any heed to the\Nyapping of that mangy dog.
Dialogue: 55,0:05:13.61,0:05:16.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So, I'm a mangy dog, am I?
Dialogue: 55,0:05:16.91,0:05:19.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Screw you, cat bastard.
Dialogue: 55,0:05:27.12,0:05:27.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Honestly!
Dialogue: 55,0:05:27.91,0:05:29.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Both of you, stop it!
Dialogue: 55,0:05:29.58,0:05:32.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Jabra certainly is\Ntouchy today, isn't he?
Dialogue: 55,0:05:32.31,0:05:33.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Did something happen to him?
Dialogue: 55,0:05:33.88,0:05:36.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All the guards on the\Nisland are talking about it!
Dialogue: 55,0:05:36.55,0:05:38.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Jabra's been in a bad mood\N'cause he got dumped
Dialogue: 55,0:05:38.55,0:05:41.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,by that waitress,\NGatherine the other day.
Dialogue: 55,0:05:41.85,0:05:43.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So that's it.
Dialogue: 55,0:05:43.19,0:05:44.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, now hold on a sec!
Dialogue: 55,0:05:44.82,0:05:47.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's a secret-why do\Npeople know about that!
Dialogue: 55,0:05:47.07,0:05:50.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,'Cause I told everyone here\Nhow sad and lonely you are!
Dialogue: 55,0:05:50.14,0:05:51.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Chapapa!
Dialogue: 55,0:05:51.07,0:05:53.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I should've known!
Dialogue: 55,0:05:57.30,0:05:58.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Geez!
Dialogue: 55,0:05:58.33,0:06:02.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is what you get for doing that\Nstupid ranking nonsense right off the bat!
Dialogue: 55,0:06:02.44,0:06:04.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's hardly any point in bickering
Dialogue: 55,0:06:04.04,0:06:08.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,over who's strongest when your Six Powers\Ntraining has made you all superhuman.
Dialogue: 55,0:06:08.84,0:06:12.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Power Level 500 should be\Nmore than anyone needs, right?
Dialogue: 55,0:06:12.38,0:06:15.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's saying that cause he's level 9.
Dialogue: 55,0:06:15.35,0:06:17.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Even weaker than a guard, chapapa!
Dialogue: 55,0:06:17.75,0:06:18.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who cares!
Dialogue: 55,0:06:18.82,0:06:21.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You guys are the muscle...I\Njust give the orders!
Dialogue: 55,0:06:21.19,0:06:24.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Besides, I have my special\Nsword to use in a pinch.
Dialogue: 55,0:06:24.06,0:06:24.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's all right, Chief.
Dialogue: 55,0:06:24.93,0:06:27.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We've always known how weak you are.
Dialogue: 55,0:06:28.66,0:06:30.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Come on now, Kalifa.
Dialogue: 55,0:06:30.23,0:06:33.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's no need to\Nbe so blunt about it!
Dialogue: 55,0:06:33.33,0:06:34.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's sexual harassment.
Dialogue: 55,0:06:34.67,0:06:35.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 55,0:06:35.37,0:06:36.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Because I replied to you?
Dialogue: 55,0:06:38.37,0:06:39.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,By the way.
Dialogue: 55,0:06:39.57,0:06:40.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 55,0:06:40.22,0:06:40.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What now?
Dialogue: 55,0:06:41.71,0:06:43.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's sexual harassment.
Dialogue: 55,0:06:43.15,0:06:44.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My existence?
Dialogue: 55,0:06:45.37,0:06:46.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yoiyoi!
Dialogue: 55,0:06:46.34,0:06:47.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kalifa!
Dialogue: 55,0:06:47.38,0:06:51.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You are showing very poor form!
Dialogue: 55,0:06:51.00,0:06:54.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Allow me to apologiiize,\Ndeaaar chiiief.
Dialogue: 55,0:06:54.79,0:06:57.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,By putting this blade to my belly!
Dialogue: 55,0:06:57.79,0:06:59.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Seppuku!
Dialogue: 55,0:06:59.29,0:07:00.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Iron Body!
Dialogue: 55,0:07:01.36,0:07:04.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't even die right.
Dialogue: 55,0:07:04.93,0:07:08.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you wanna die that bad,\NI'd be happy to help!
Dialogue: 55,0:07:08.08,0:07:10.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Although it's been a long time\Ncoming, needless to say,
Dialogue: 55,0:07:10.83,0:07:15.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Needless to say, I'm extremely pleased\Nwith your performance in this mission.
Dialogue: 55,0:07:15.38,0:07:18.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,By the way, although it\Nisn't exactly a reward for all
Dialogue: 55,0:07:18.79,0:07:22.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,your hard work, I do have\Nsomething I want to give you.
Dialogue: 55,0:07:22.36,0:07:25.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But we can take care of that later.
Dialogue: 55,0:07:25.73,0:07:29.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,For now, let's meet them, shall we?
Dialogue: 55,0:07:29.36,0:07:31.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The hope of the entire world.
Dialogue: 55,0:07:43.24,0:07:43.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hurry up!
Dialogue: 55,0:07:43.94,0:07:45.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Move it!
Dialogue: 55,0:07:47.31,0:07:49.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You too, big guy!
Dialogue: 55,0:08:01.42,0:08:03.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I couldn't be happier!
Dialogue: 55,0:08:03.42,0:08:04.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Amazing work.
Dialogue: 55,0:08:04.62,0:08:10.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You survived the "accident"\Neight years ago, Cutty Flam.
Dialogue: 55,0:08:10.16,0:08:13.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And now, I have you as well.
Dialogue: 55,0:08:13.23,0:08:17.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The world's most dangerous\Nwoman, Nico Robin.
Dialogue: 55,0:08:17.95,0:08:19.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's so unfortunate.
Dialogue: 55,0:08:19.39,0:08:20.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The rest of the world may never know
Dialogue: 55,0:08:20.49,0:08:24.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,what a glorious accomplishment\NCP9 achieved today.
Dialogue: 55,0:08:24.32,0:08:27.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,One of the drawbacks of being\Na secret agency and all that.
Dialogue: 55,0:08:27.59,0:08:30.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes, a pity.
Dialogue: 55,0:08:30.00,0:08:35.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Honestly, the news of your capture\Ncould take years to reach the public.
Dialogue: 55,0:08:35.59,0:08:37.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The "justice" those old geezers
Dialogue: 55,0:08:37.09,0:08:40.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,in the current World Government\Ndole out is far too lenient!
Dialogue: 55,0:08:40.89,0:08:44.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Without sacrifice,\Ngoals cannot be achieved.
Dialogue: 55,0:08:44.81,0:08:49.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I mean, this is world peace we're\Nworking for... it's not easy!
Dialogue: 55,0:08:49.94,0:08:52.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Surely there can't be\Nan issue with sacrificing
Dialogue: 55,0:08:52.35,0:08:56.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,a few fools along the way who hinder our\Nwork for the sake of the greater good.
Dialogue: 55,0:08:56.46,0:08:57.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 55,0:08:57.39,0:08:58.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You know, if everyone\Nwould just give us
Dialogue: 55,0:08:58.46,0:09:01.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,what we ask for obediently\Nand without question.
Dialogue: 55,0:09:01.70,0:09:04.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Then we wouldn't need to\Ngo to such extreme measures.
Dialogue: 55,0:09:04.40,0:09:07.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Like we had to with poor Tom!
Dialogue: 55,0:09:10.23,0:09:12.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That traitor deserved it!
Dialogue: 55,0:09:14.40,0:09:15.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Crazy bastard!
Dialogue: 55,0:09:16.28,0:09:19.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tom put his life on the line\Nto protect those blueprints!
Dialogue: 55,0:09:19.13,0:09:22.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Because idiots like you exist!
Dialogue: 55,0:09:26.45,0:09:27.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?!
Dialogue: 55,0:09:28.28,0:09:30.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't just sit there, help me!
Dialogue: 55,0:10:44.29,0:10:46.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is Main Island, calling the Chief.
Dialogue: 55,0:10:46.39,0:10:47.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Spandam, come in!
Dialogue: 55,0:10:47.79,0:10:49.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I repeat! Come in!
Dialogue: 55,0:10:49.46,0:10:50.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's no good!
Dialogue: 55,0:10:50.36,0:10:51.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No signal!
Dialogue: 55,0:10:51.46,0:10:52.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 55,0:10:52.36,0:10:54.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Maybe he's got the receiver off again.
Dialogue: 55,0:10:54.33,0:10:55.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Awww, seriously?!
Dialogue: 55,0:10:55.63,0:10:58.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Could his timing be any worse?!
Dialogue: 55,0:10:58.71,0:10:59.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 55,0:10:59.41,0:11:01.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Anyone see where Straw Hat went?
Dialogue: 55,0:11:01.31,0:11:02.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's right beneath you!
Dialogue: 55,0:11:02.91,0:11:03.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 55,0:11:03.78,0:11:04.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He is?!
Dialogue: 55,0:11:07.08,0:11:09.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Everyone attack him from all sides!
Dialogue: 55,0:11:09.55,0:11:10.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now!
Dialogue: 55,0:11:10.41,0:11:11.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There he is!
Dialogue: 55,0:11:11.08,0:11:11.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We got him!
Dialogue: 55,0:11:11.78,0:11:12.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Damn!
Dialogue: 55,0:11:12.48,0:11:13.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm cornered!
Dialogue: 55,0:11:20.76,0:11:26.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now Gum-Gum Volcano!
Dialogue: 55,0:11:47.35,0:11:48.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 55,0:11:50.85,0:11:51.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 55,0:11:51.89,0:11:53.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The walls are falling!
Dialogue: 55,0:11:55.53,0:11:56.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Run!
Dialogue: 55,0:11:59.33,0:12:05.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now Gum-Gum Gatling!
Dialogue: 55,0:12:06.58,0:12:08.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 55,0:12:13.72,0:12:14.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Chief Spandam!
Dialogue: 55,0:12:14.52,0:12:15.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Please, come in!
Dialogue: 55,0:12:15.91,0:12:17.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We need your orders, sir!
Dialogue: 55,0:12:17.05,0:12:19.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We can't stop Straw Hat Luffy!
Dialogue: 55,0:12:20.75,0:12:21.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Get ready!
Dialogue: 55,0:12:22.23,0:12:23.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's heading towards the courthouse!
Dialogue: 55,0:12:23.86,0:12:25.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We need those defenses lined up!
Dialogue: 55,0:12:25.47,0:12:26.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Move it, men!
Dialogue: 55,0:12:26.40,0:12:27.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shut up, already!
Dialogue: 55,0:12:27.94,0:12:29.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's with all the yelling?
Dialogue: 55,0:12:29.40,0:12:32.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You guys woke me up!
Dialogue: 55,0:12:32.27,0:12:35.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Chief Justice!
Dialogue: 55,0:12:35.07,0:12:36.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yep!
Dialogue: 55,0:12:36.02,0:12:37.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You got it!
Dialogue: 55,0:12:37.09,0:12:37.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's me!
Dialogue: 55,0:12:37.79,0:12:40.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Chief Justice of Enies Lobby!
Dialogue: 55,0:12:40.58,0:12:41.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,On the left!
Dialogue: 55,0:12:41.84,0:12:45.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My name is Left Baskerville!
Dialogue: 55,0:12:45.03,0:12:46.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,On the right!
Dialogue: 55,0:12:46.33,0:12:49.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I am Right Baskerville!
Dialogue: 55,0:12:49.20,0:12:54.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And, located in the center,\NI am known as Central Freeway!
Dialogue: 55,0:12:54.35,0:12:55.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Say what?!
Dialogue: 55,0:12:55.40,0:12:56.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Chief Justice.
Dialogue: 55,0:12:55.65,0:12:56.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Uh.
Dialogue: 55,0:12:57.22,0:12:58.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We've got a problem.
Dialogue: 55,0:12:58.36,0:13:00.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's a pirate on a rampage\Non the Main Island, sir.
Dialogue: 55,0:13:00.69,0:13:04.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But we can't get in touch with Chief\NSpandam to get an update on our orders.
Dialogue: 55,0:13:04.28,0:13:06.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Please, sir, take\Ncommand on his behalf!
Dialogue: 55,0:13:06.13,0:13:07.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A pirate, you say?
Dialogue: 55,0:13:07.60,0:13:11.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All pirates are guilty!
Dialogue: 55,0:13:12.80,0:13:14.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There hasn't been a trial yet!
Dialogue: 55,0:13:14.27,0:13:17.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Even so, I think he's innocent!
Dialogue: 55,0:13:17.63,0:13:18.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Then.
Dialogue: 55,0:13:18.33,0:13:20.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll be neutral.
Dialogue: 55,0:13:20.03,0:13:20.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Death!
Dialogue: 55,0:13:20.83,0:13:23.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Say what?!
Dialogue: 55,0:13:23.96,0:13:24.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Chief Justice!
Dialogue: 55,0:13:24.99,0:13:26.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's trouble, sir!
Dialogue: 55,0:13:26.46,0:13:27.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I just received a report.
Dialogue: 55,0:13:27.63,0:13:31.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Straw Hat's accomplices have\Ntaken out Kaahii at the Front Gate.
Dialogue: 55,0:13:31.01,0:13:33.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oimo's still fighting,\Nbut won't last much longer!
Dialogue: 55,0:13:33.01,0:13:33.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Say what?!
Dialogue: 55,0:13:33.71,0:13:36.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That gate must not be breached!
Dialogue: 55,0:13:37.19,0:13:40.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Send one hundred Watchdogs\Nto that location immediately!
Dialogue: 55,0:13:40.88,0:13:46.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sir!
Dialogue: 55,0:13:46.72,0:13:47.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're in trouble!
Dialogue: 55,0:13:47.79,0:13:49.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Our 5 minute window is up!
Dialogue: 55,0:13:49.67,0:13:50.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Damn!
Dialogue: 55,0:13:50.37,0:13:51.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 55,0:13:51.11,0:13:53.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We've got to get that\Ngate open for Rocketman!
Dialogue: 55,0:13:53.27,0:13:55.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I will never let you through!
Dialogue: 55,0:13:57.13,0:13:57.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay guys!
Dialogue: 55,0:13:57.83,0:13:58.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We picked the gate's lock!
Dialogue: 55,0:13:58.70,0:14:01.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All you have to do now is push it open!
Dialogue: 55,0:14:01.54,0:14:02.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 55,0:14:02.24,0:14:02.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, crap!
Dialogue: 55,0:14:02.94,0:14:03.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nice work!
Dialogue: 55,0:14:03.65,0:14:04.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You heard her!
Dialogue: 55,0:14:04.35,0:14:05.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Move it!
Dialogue: 55,0:14:06.55,0:14:09.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You stay away from that gate!
Dialogue: 55,0:14:09.72,0:14:12.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Rope Action!
Dialogue: 55,0:14:12.46,0:14:13.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Top Knot!
Dialogue: 55,0:14:17.53,0:14:18.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 55,0:14:18.39,0:14:20.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Those Galley-La foremen are incredible!
Dialogue: 55,0:14:20.59,0:14:23.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You think this puny\Nrope is gonna hold me?!
Dialogue: 55,0:14:24.76,0:14:25.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Franky Family!
Dialogue: 55,0:14:25.89,0:14:26.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pull!
Dialogue: 55,0:14:26.76,0:14:28.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 55,0:14:28.32,0:14:29.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No problem!
Dialogue: 55,0:14:29.96,0:14:30.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gomorrah!
Dialogue: 55,0:14:30.63,0:14:31.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sodom!
Dialogue: 55,0:14:31.33,0:14:32.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Grab that rope!
Dialogue: 55,0:14:38.88,0:14:39.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Move it, Franky Family!
Dialogue: 55,0:14:40.74,0:14:43.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't stop until that\Ngate is wide open!
Dialogue: 55,0:14:43.20,0:14:44.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oi, oi, oi!
Dialogue: 55,0:14:44.64,0:14:45.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hold on!
Dialogue: 55,0:14:45.54,0:14:46.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Slow down!
Dialogue: 55,0:14:46.34,0:14:47.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm getting dizzy!
Dialogue: 55,0:14:47.64,0:14:49.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Push the gate!
Dialogue: 55,0:14:54.79,0:14:55.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 55,0:14:55.49,0:14:56.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Impossible!
Dialogue: 55,0:14:56.56,0:14:58.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The gates are opening!
Dialogue: 55,0:14:58.29,0:15:00.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What the hell is Oimo doing?!
Dialogue: 55,0:15:32.00,0:15:33.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's no way.
Dialogue: 55,0:15:33.51,0:15:34.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is that a sea train?
Dialogue: 55,0:15:34.84,0:15:36.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's going on here?
Dialogue: 55,0:15:50.46,0:15:51.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It is!
Dialogue: 55,0:15:51.16,0:15:51.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Look at it!
Dialogue: 55,0:15:51.82,0:15:52.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A sea train!
Dialogue: 55,0:15:52.53,0:15:53.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And it's not the Puffing Tom!
Dialogue: 55,0:15:53.73,0:15:57.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's another one, and it's\Nheaded this way at full speed!
Dialogue: 55,0:15:57.46,0:15:58.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're crazy!
Dialogue: 55,0:15:58.43,0:16:00.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What're they trying\Nto do...jump the fence?
Dialogue: 55,0:16:03.35,0:16:04.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 55,0:16:04.05,0:16:04.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Close the gate!
Dialogue: 55,0:16:05.28,0:16:07.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We can't let them through!
Dialogue: 55,0:16:07.02,0:16:07.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 55,0:16:07.72,0:16:08.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Get those doors shut!
Dialogue: 55,0:16:19.12,0:16:20.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, granny!
Dialogue: 55,0:16:20.08,0:16:20.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah? What is it?
Dialogue: 55,0:16:20.93,0:16:24.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I need you to give me as much\Nspeed as you've got, okay?
Dialogue: 55,0:16:24.06,0:16:26.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It seems we've had to\Nswitch up our plans a little.
Dialogue: 55,0:16:26.37,0:16:30.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Your green-haired samurai friend says you\Nall should find something to hold onto.
Dialogue: 55,0:16:30.76,0:16:32.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Find something to hold on to
Dialogue: 55,0:16:32.65,0:16:34.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Moss-for-Brains!
Dialogue: 55,0:16:34.48,0:16:35.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's going on out here?
Dialogue: 55,0:16:35.73,0:16:38.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They, uh, they closed the Main Gate.
Dialogue: 55,0:16:38.86,0:16:40.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They what?!
Dialogue: 55,0:16:40.25,0:16:41.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is bad!
Dialogue: 55,0:16:41.90,0:16:42.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're gonna crash!
Dialogue: 55,0:16:42.90,0:16:44.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What are we gonna do?!\NWhat are we gonna do?!
Dialogue: 55,0:16:44.83,0:16:48.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dodge it, Kokoro!
Dialogue: 55,0:16:48.44,0:16:50.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I've got a plan.
Dialogue: 55,0:16:50.27,0:16:51.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 55,0:16:56.38,0:16:57.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Frog!
Dialogue: 55,0:16:57.08,0:16:57.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,See fence?
Dialogue: 55,0:16:57.68,0:16:58.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Smash!
Dialogue: 55,0:16:58.41,0:17:01.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 55,0:17:01.75,0:17:03.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gero!
Dialogue: 55,0:17:06.25,0:17:08.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gero, Gero!
Dialogue: 55,0:17:13.16,0:17:16.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gero, Gero, Gero, Gero!
Dialogue: 55,0:17:25.58,0:17:26.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's his plan?!
Dialogue: 55,0:17:27.04,0:17:30.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Does he realize what's gonna happen\Nwhen we run into that fence?!
Dialogue: 55,0:17:39.02,0:17:42.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Impossible!
Dialogue: 55,0:17:42.54,0:17:43.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That seatrain!
Dialogue: 55,0:17:43.48,0:17:45.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's flying!
Dialogue: 55,0:17:46.01,0:17:47.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 55,0:17:47.62,0:17:49.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're gonna die!
Dialogue: 55,0:17:49.09,0:17:49.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 55,0:17:49.93,0:17:52.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But I don't wanna die!
Dialogue: 55,0:17:52.96,0:17:55.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nami! This way! I'll\Nsave you! Fall into my arms!
Dialogue: 55,0:17:55.60,0:17:56.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shut up, you idiot!
Dialogue: 55,0:17:56.43,0:17:58.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I've got enough problems right now!
Dialogue: 55,0:18:03.34,0:18:04.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Zoro!
Dialogue: 55,0:18:04.27,0:18:09.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You'd better have thought long and hard\Nabout how you're gonna land this thing!
Dialogue: 55,0:18:09.45,0:18:11.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Of course I have!
Dialogue: 55,0:18:19.12,0:18:20.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We fall.
Dialogue: 55,0:18:20.09,0:18:20.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gero!
Dialogue: 55,0:18:20.96,0:18:23.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I hate you!
Dialogue: 55,0:18:23.59,0:18:26.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We'll find out if luck's\Non our side soon enough.
Dialogue: 55,0:18:29.56,0:18:31.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oimo's going down!
Dialogue: 55,0:18:50.16,0:18:50.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 55,0:18:50.82,0:18:51.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What a crew!
Dialogue: 55,0:18:51.79,0:18:53.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you Straw Hats?
Dialogue: 55,0:18:53.26,0:18:54.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Damn straight!
Dialogue: 55,0:18:54.26,0:18:56.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is that so?!
Dialogue: 55,0:18:56.74,0:18:57.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 55,0:18:57.81,0:18:59.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's move. Time's a' wasting.
Dialogue: 55,0:18:59.71,0:19:00.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We've gotta clear a path.
Dialogue: 55,0:19:00.91,0:19:01.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And fast.
Dialogue: 55,0:19:01.78,0:19:02.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 55,0:19:02.48,0:19:03.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You heard him, guys!
Dialogue: 55,0:19:03.75,0:19:05.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We need to go deeper!
Dialogue: 55,0:19:05.18,0:19:06.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's make a hole!
Dialogue: 55,0:19:06.68,0:19:09.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 55,0:19:19.27,0:19:23.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Paulie! No!
Dialogue: 55,0:19:23.91,0:19:25.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who in the hell are you?
Dialogue: 55,0:19:25.85,0:19:26.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who, us?
Dialogue: 55,0:19:26.88,0:19:27.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll tell you.
Dialogue: 55,0:19:27.98,0:19:30.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The First-Class Guards of Enies Lobby.
Dialogue: 55,0:19:30.65,0:19:33.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Watchdogs of the Law.
Dialogue: 55,0:19:33.39,0:19:36.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,By order of Chief Justice Baskerville.
Dialogue: 55,0:19:36.24,0:19:39.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,For your crimes,\Nyou're sentenced to death!
Dialogue: 55,0:19:40.55,0:19:41.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Damn.
Dialogue: 55,0:19:41.25,0:19:42.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They just keep coming!
Dialogue: 55,0:19:42.85,0:19:44.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,One after another.
Dialogue: 55,0:19:44.15,0:19:45.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oimo!
Dialogue: 55,0:19:45.09,0:19:46.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 55,0:19:46.38,0:19:48.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How could you let this pirate\Nriff-raff open the gate?
Dialogue: 55,0:19:48.85,0:19:50.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with you?
Dialogue: 55,0:19:54.40,0:19:56.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Can't believe I passed out!
Dialogue: 55,0:19:57.57,0:20:02.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That giant's back up and on his feet!
Dialogue: 55,0:19:58.14,0:19:58.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Oh crap!
Dialogue: 55,0:20:04.04,0:20:05.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Little jerks!
Dialogue: 55,0:20:05.24,0:20:06.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're dead!
Dialogue: 55,0:20:06.95,0:20:07.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You'll pay!
Dialogue: 55,0:20:07.65,0:20:08.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 55,0:20:34.66,0:20:35.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What the...?!
Dialogue: 55,0:20:35.59,0:20:38.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Rocketman fell from the sky!
Dialogue: 55,0:20:38.06,0:20:41.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We opened those gates for nothing?!
Dialogue: 55,0:20:49.43,0:20:50.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 55,0:20:50.80,0:20:52.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What the hell just happened?
Dialogue: 55,0:20:52.10,0:20:54.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Man, that was some landing!
Dialogue: 55,0:20:54.07,0:20:56.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Do you think that they're okay?
Dialogue: 55,0:21:01.81,0:21:04.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're not coming out.
Dialogue: 55,0:21:20.07,0:21:21.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey! You guys all right?
Dialogue: 55,0:21:25.24,0:21:25.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 55,0:21:25.94,0:21:26.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Impossible!
Dialogue: 55,0:21:26.87,0:21:28.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who are those two?
Dialogue: 55,0:21:35.18,0:21:39.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh... Maybe we should have\Nintroduced ourselves first.
Dialogue: 55,0:21:39.67,0:21:40.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nah.
Dialogue: 55,0:21:40.54,0:21:42.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'd rather let my feet do the talking.
Dialogue: 55,0:21:42.24,0:21:44.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Straw Hats are here!
Dialogue: 55,0:21:44.11,0:21:47.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We've been waiting for you!
Dialogue: 55,0:21:49.55,0:21:50.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Excellent.
Dialogue: 55,0:21:52.58,0:21:53.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just like I planned it.
Dialogue: 55,0:21:53.98,0:21:54.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 55,0:21:54.68,0:21:55.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Really?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.68,0:09:37.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kumadoriii!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.02,0:09:43.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yoyoi! What is your desiiiiiiire?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.40,0:09:46.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Isn't it obvious?! Help me! Make him stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.44,0:09:50.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Saa. Saa. Saa!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.17,0:10:14.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now Gum-Gum Gatling!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.01,0:10:17.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now Gum-Gum Whip!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.18,0:10:21.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Giant Sickle!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.23,0:10:25.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bell!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.23,0:10:29.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hammer!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.65,0:10:32.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bazooka!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.53,0:10:40.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gum-Gum Stamp!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.09,0:15:02.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A little more.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.81,0:15:17.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They've breached the gate!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.70,0:15:26.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey! Hey!
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{=3}===============================DIALOGUE============================
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{=4}============================SIGNS AND TITLE=========================
